	(gr_text "NOTES:\n1. Assembly to meet IPC-A-610 Class 2 standards\n2. Polarity marks:\n  a. Dots and bevels near ICs and modules indicate pin 1\n  b. Dots and bevels near connectors indicate pin 1; mechanical features are shown when feasible\n  c. '+' symbols near polarized capacitors indicate positive terminal\n  d. Bands near diodes indicate cathode, although standard diode symbols are used wherever possible\n  If polarity issues arise, please e-mail for clarification (understood that this may delay order)"
